"region], [member cell_size] or [member offset] are changed. [method "
"is_dirty] will return [code]true[/code] if this is the case and this needs "
"to be called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All point data (solidity and weight scale) will be cleared."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/AStarGrid2D.xml
msgid ""
"The cell shape. Affects how the positions are placed in the grid. If "
