msgid ""
"An audio effect instance manipulates the audio it receives for a given "
"effect. This instance is automatically created by an [AudioEffect] when it "
"is added to a bus, and should usually not be created directly. If necessary, "
"it can be fetched at run-time with [method "
"AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."
