"See [method add_theme_font_size_override]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se houver uma sobrescrita local para um tamanho de "
"fonte de tema com o [param name] especificado neste nó [Control]. Veja "
"[method add_theme_font_size_override]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
