#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml doc/classes/NativeMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"Define o deslocamento horizontal do item no [param idx] dado. [b]Nota:[/b] "
