#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"As opposed to [constant TYPE_PERLIN], gradients exist in a simplex lattice "
"rather than a grid lattice, avoiding directional artifacts. Internally uses "
"FastNoiseLite's OpenSimplex2 noise type."
msgstr ""

