msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance along the path as a number in the range 0.0 (for the first "
"vertex) to 1.0 (for the last). This is just another way of expressing the "
"progress within the path, as the offset supplied is multiplied internally by "
"the path's length.\n"
"It can be set or get only if the [PathFollow2D] is the child of a [Path2D] "
"which is part of the scene tree, and that this [Path2D] has a [Curve2D] with "
"a non-zero length. Otherwise, trying to set this field will print an error, "
"and getting this field will return [code]0.0[/code]."
