"[member min_sample_shading]. See the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#primsrast-sampleshading]per-"
"sample shading Vulkan documentation[/url] for more details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
