"performed for each fragment. Must be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusive). Only effective if [member enable_sample_shading] is "
"[code]true[/code]. If [member min_sample_shading] is [code]1.0[/code], "
"fragment invocation must only read from the coverage index sample. Tile "
"image access must not be used if [member enable_sample_shading] is [i]not[/"
"i] [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
