"Draws the global illumination buffer from [VoxelGI] or SDFGI. Requires "
"[VoxelGI] (at least one visible baked VoxelGI node) or SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) to be enabled to have a visible effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Disable mesh LOD. All meshes are drawn with full detail, which can be used "
"to compare performance."
