#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the glow effect to the scene after modifying the glow influence based "
"on the scene value; dark values will be highly influenced by glow and bright "
"values will not be influenced by glow. This approach avoids bright values "
"becoming overly bright from the glow effect. [member "
"Environment.tonemap_white] is used to determine the maximum scene value "
"where the glow should have no influence. When [member "
"Environment.tonemap_mode] is set to [constant "
"Environment.TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] is "
"[code]true[/code], the parent window's [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] will be used as the maximum scene value."
