"texture_normal]) is recommended. If [member texture_normal] is not set, the "
"[TextureButton] will still receive input events and be clickable, but the "
"user will not be able to see it unless they activate another one of its "
"states with a texture assigned (e.g., hover over it to show [member "
"texture_hover])."
