"the given [param terrain] for the given [param terrain_set]. The function "
"will also connect two successive cell in the path with the same terrain. "
"This function might update neighboring tiles if needed to create correct "
"terrain transitions.\n"
"If [param ignore_empty_terrains] is [code]true[/code], empty terrains will "
"be ignored when trying to find the best fitting tile for the given terrain "
"constraints.\n"
"If [param layer] is negative, the layers are accessed from the last one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To work correctly, this method requires the TileMap's TileSet "
