"It allows users to provide directional input by dragging a virtual tip "
"within a defined circular area.\n"
"This control can simulate directional actions (see [member action_up], "
"[member action_down], [member action_left], and [member action_right]), "
"which are triggered when the joystick is moved in the corresponding "
"directions."
