#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Allows the creation of ZIP files."
msgstr "Permite a criação de arquivos do tipo zip."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"This class implements a writer that allows storing the multiple blobs in a "
"ZIP archive. See also [ZIPReader] and [PCKPacker].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Create a ZIP archive with a single file at its root.\n"
"func write_zip_file():\n"
"\tvar writer = ZIPPacker.new()\n"
"\tvar err = writer.open(\"user://archive.zip\")\n"
"\tif err != OK:\n"
"\t\treturn err\n"
"\twriter.start_file(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"\twriter.write_file(\"Hello World\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\twriter.close_file()\n"
"\n"
"\twriter.close()\n"
"\treturn OK\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Esta classe implementa um escritor que permite armazenar múltiplos blobs em "
"um arquivo ZIP. Veja também [ZIPReader] e [PCKPacker].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Cria um arquivo ZIP com um único arquivo na sua raiz.\n"
"func write_zip_file():\n"
"\tvar writer = ZIPPacker.new()\n"
"\tvar err = writer.open(\"user://archive.zip\")\n"
"\tif err != OK:\n"
"\t\treturn err\n"
"\twriter.start_file(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"\twriter.write_file(\"Hello World\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\twriter.close_file()\n"
"\n"
"\twriter.close()\n"
"\treturn OK\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds directory to the archive. If [param modified_time] is set to [code]0[/"
"code], current system time is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Directories are automatically created when [method start_file] "
"is called, use this function before adding files to create directories with "
"custom permissions and modification time."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid "Closes the underlying resources used by this instance."
msgstr "Fecha os recursos subjacentes usados por esta instância."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Stops writing to a file within the archive.\n"
"It will fail if there is no open file."
msgstr ""
"Para de escrever no arquivo dentro do ficheiro.\n"
"A ação falhará se não existir arquivo aberto."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Opens a zip file for writing at the given path using the specified write "
"mode.\n"
"This must be called before everything else."
msgstr ""
"Abre um arquivo zip para escrita no caminho especificado usando o modo de "
"escrita especificado.\n"
"Precisa ser chamado antes de todo o resto."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Starts writing to a file within the archive. Only one file can be written at "
"the same time. If [param modified_time] is set to [code]0[/code], current "
"system time is used.\n"
"Must be called after [method open]."
msgstr ""
"Inicia a escrita em um arquivo dentro do arquivo (archive). Apenas um "
"arquivo pode ser escrito por vez. Se [param modified_time] for definido como "
"[code]0[/code], o horário atual do sistema será usado. Deve ser chamado após "
"[method open]."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Write the given [param data] to the file.\n"
"Needs to be called after [method start_file]."
msgstr ""
"Escreve [param data] dado no arquivo.\n"
"Precisa ser chamado depois de [method start_file]."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"The compression level used when [method start_file] is called. Use [enum "
"ZIPPacker.CompressionLevel] as a reference."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid "Create a new zip archive at the given path."
msgstr "Cria um novo arquivo zip no caminho especificado."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Append a new zip archive to the end of the already existing file at the "
"given path."
msgstr ""
"Anexa um novo arquivo zip no fim do arquivo já existente no caminho "
"especificado."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid "Add new files to the existing zip archive at the given path."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Start a file with the default Deflate compression level ([code]6[/code]). "
"This is a good compromise between speed and file size."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Start a file with no compression. This is also known as the \"Store\" "
"compression mode and is the fastest method of packing files inside a ZIP "
"archive. Consider using this mode for files that are already compressed "
"(such as JPEG, PNG, MP3, or Ogg Vorbis files)."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Start a file with the fastest Deflate compression level ([code]1[/code]). "
"This is fast to compress, but results in larger file sizes than [constant "
"COMPRESSION_DEFAULT]. Decompression speed is generally unaffected by the "
"chosen compression level."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Start a file with the best Deflate compression level ([code]9[/code]). This "
"is slow to compress, but results in smaller file sizes than [constant "
"COMPRESSION_DEFAULT]. Decompression speed is generally unaffected by the "
"chosen compression level."
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Allows reading the content of a ZIP file."
msgstr "Permite a criação de arquivos do tipo zip."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"This class implements a reader that can extract the content of individual "
"files inside a ZIP archive. See also [ZIPPacker].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Read a single file from a ZIP archive.\n"
"func read_zip_file():\n"
"\tvar reader = ZIPReader.new()\n"
"\tvar err = reader.open(\"user://archive.zip\")\n"
"\tif err != OK:\n"
"\t\treturn PackedByteArray()\n"
"\tvar res = reader.read_file(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"\treader.close()\n"
"\treturn res\n"
"\n"
"# Extract all files from a ZIP archive, preserving the directories within.\n"
"# This acts like the \"Extract all\" functionality from most archive "
"managers.\n"
"func extract_all_from_zip():\n"
"\tvar reader = ZIPReader.new()\n"
"\treader.open(\"res://archive.zip\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Destination directory for the extracted files (this folder must exist "
"before extraction).\n"
"\t# Not all ZIP archives put everything in a single root folder,\n"
"\t# which means several files/folders may be created in `root_dir` after "
"extraction.\n"
"\tvar root_dir = DirAccess.open(\"user://\")\n"
"\n"
"\tvar files = reader.get_files()\n"
"\tfor file_path in files:\n"
"\t\t# If the current entry is a directory.\n"
"\t\tif file_path.ends_with(\"/\"):\n"
"\t\t\troot_dir.make_dir_recursive(file_path)\n"
"\t\t\tcontinue\n"
"\n"
"\t\t# Write file contents, creating folders automatically when needed.\n"
"\t\t# Not all ZIP archives are strictly ordered, so we need to do this in "
"case\n"
"\t\t# the file entry comes before the folder entry.\n"
"\t\troot_dir.make_dir_recursive(root_dir.get_current_dir().path_join(file_path).get_base_dir())\n"
"\t\tvar file = "
"FileAccess.open(root_dir.get_current_dir().path_join(file_path), "
"FileAccess.WRITE)\n"
"\t\tvar buffer = reader.read_file(file_path)\n"
"\t\tfile.store_buffer(buffer)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file exists in the loaded zip archive.\n"
"Must be called after [method open]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o arquivo existir no arquivo zip carregado. "
"Deve ser chamado após [method open]."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the compression level of the file in the loaded zip archive. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if the file doesn't exist or any other error occurs. Must be "
"called after [method open]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nível de compressão do arquivo no arquivo zip carregado. Retorna "
"[code]-1[/code] se o arquivo não existir ou se qualquer outro erro ocorrer. "
"Deve ser chamado após [method open]."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of names of all files in the loaded archive.\n"
"Must be called after [method open]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de nomes de todos os arquivos no arquivo carregado.\n"
"Deve ser chamado depois de [method open]."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the zip archive at the given [param path] and reads its file index."
msgstr ""
"Abre o arquivo zip no caminho dado [param path] e lê o seu índice de "
"arquivos."

#: modules/zip/doc_classes/ZIPReader.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the whole content of a file in the loaded zip archive into memory and "
"returns it.\n"
"Must be called after [method open]."
msgstr ""
"Carrega todo o conteúdo de um arquivo no arquivo zip carregado em memória e "
"retorna-o.\n"
"Deve ser chamado depois de[método aberto]."
